lip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent\">chrome word</span></span></span><span class=\"style-y2k-anat-plus\">+</span>\n      <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"pink\"><span class=\"style-y2k-sw\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(120deg,#ffd9ef 50%,#bfe3ff 50%)\"></span></span><span class=\"style-y2k-anat-plus\">+</span>\n      <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"bubble\"><span class=\"style-y2k-sw\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;padding:5px 14px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#ffc9e5,#f556a8);box-shadow:inset 0 2px 2px rgba(255,255,255,.9)\">Bubble</span></span></span><span class=\"style-y2k-anat-plus\">+</span>\n      <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"gloss\"><span class=\"style-y2k-sw\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(180deg,#c9ecff,#3d9fe8);position:relative\"><span style=\"position:absolute;top:4px;left:10px;right:10px;height:10px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,.95),rgba(255,255,255,0))\"></span></span></span><span class=\"style-y2k-anat-plus\">+</span>\n      <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"star\"><span class=\"style-y2k-sw\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(120deg,#ffd9ef,#bfe3ff);color:#fff;text-shadow:0 0 6px rgba(255,158,214,.95);font-size:15px\">✦</span></span>\n    </span>","parts":[{"key":"chrome","cn":"金属铬渐变","en":"Chrome","desc":"可用银灰渐变和 background-clip: text 模拟金属感，优先放在短标题","desc_en":"You can use silver-gray gradient and background-clip: text to simulate a metallic feel, giving priority to short titles."},{"key":"pink","cn":"年代配色","en":"Color","desc":"示例使用粉与冰蓝；实际配色要结合品牌、对比度和内容层级","desc_en":"Example uses pink and ice blue; actual color matching will depend on branding, contrast, and content hierarchy"},{"key":"bubble","cn":"气泡圆角","en":"Bubble Shape","desc":"胶囊形和大圆角能带来塑料气泡感，半径按组件尺寸调整","desc_en":"Capsule shape and large rounded corners create a plastic bubble feel, with radius adjusted to component size"},{"key":"gloss","cn":"塑料高光","en":"Gloss","desc":"用局部浅色高光提示透明或光滑材质，不能影响文字和边界","desc_en":"Use local light-colored highlights to indicate transparent or smooth materials without affecting text and borders."},{"key":"star","cn":"星星闪片","en":"Sparkles","desc":"小型星形装饰可放在留白处，为页面增加节奏但不遮挡内容","desc_en":"Small star-shaped decorations can be placed in the blank space to add rhythm to the page without blocking the content."}]},"use":[{"t":"时尚、美妆和潮流主题，需要复古数码感","m":"style-y2k-use-brand"},{"t":"音乐播放器和应援页面，强调玩乐氛围","m":"style-y2k-use-music"},{"t":"个人主页和博客皮肤，表达个人偏好","m":"style-y2k-use-homepage"},{"t":"联名和快闪活动，使用短周期强主题","m":"style-y2k-use-campaign"}],"dont":[{"t":"政务和金融核心任务中过度使用装饰","m":"style-y2k-dont-serious","bad":true},{"t":"整段正文使用金属渐变，降低可读性","m":"style-y2k-dont-text","bad":true},{"t":"整页高饱和且没有留白，造成视觉疲劳","m":"style-y2k-dont-full","bad":true},{"t":"与另一套商务风格并列使用，却没有统一规则","m":"style-y2k-dont-mix","bad":true}],"principles":[{"t":"金属渐变适合短标题和装饰，不用于大段正文","m":"style-y2k-chrome"},{"t":"选择一组带年代感的主色，并为每种颜色分配职责","m":"style-y2k-color"},{"t":"圆润轮廓可以用于按钮和卡片，但要跟随组件尺寸","m":"style-y2k-bubble"},{"t":"透明塑料和高光材质只在需要强调的区域使用","m":"style-y2k-gloss"},{"t":"星形与闪片作为点缀，不能遮挡内容和操作","m":"style-y2k-star"}],"history":[{"year":"1998","title":"iMac G3 彩色透明壳","desc":"iMac G3 采用邦迪蓝等半透明外壳，让彩色塑料成为当时消费电子中具有辨识度的材料语言。","title_en":"The translucent iMac G3 arrives","desc_en":"Its bright Bondi Blue shell made visible plastic and friendly technology central images of the approaching millennium."},{"year":"1999","title":"千禧年前夜","desc":"围绕千年虫和未来生活的文化讨论，使科技、未来与流行视觉在这一时期频繁交织。","title_en":"The eve of the millennium","desc_en":"Anxiety about the Y2K bug existed alongside an optimistic fascination with what life after 2000 might look like."},{"year":"2000-2004","title":"流行文化中的扩散","desc":"流行音乐、即时通信与消费电子中常见金属、泡泡粉和闪片等元素，形成了今天常被归入 Y2K 的视觉记忆。","title_en":"Y2K style reaches popular culture","desc_en":"Chrome, bubblegum color, rhinestones, translucent gadgets, and customized mobile phones spread through music, fashion, and software."},{"year":"2007-2015","title":"主流数字界面趋向简化","desc":"iPhone 与扁平化设计兴起后，许多数字产品减少了 glossy 质感；Y2K 元素仍在时尚、音乐和亚文化中持续出现。","title_en":"Smartphones and flat design push it aside","desc_en":"Glossy surfaces began to feel dated as the iPhone era and flatter interface systems became dominant."},{"year":"2020s","title":"复古语汇再被采用","desc":"一些年轻品牌、潮流和美妆视觉重新使用 Y2K 元素，并将其与当代排版和媒介结合。","title_en":"A new generation revives the period","desc_en":"People too young to remember the original moment rediscovered it as retro-futurism, and fashion and beauty brands followed."}],"prompt":"做一个千禧风音乐社区个人主页，展示用户资料、正在播放和留言。用有年代感的塑料质感与装饰营造玩乐感，但文字、播放操作和留言入口都要清楚，不要把页面做成关键词拼贴。","prompt_en":"Y2K social music profile, translucent plastic cards, chrome title, bubblegum pink and ice blue palette, friend profile, now-playing panel and guestbook columns, glossy rounded buttons, restrained star and sparkle accents","scenes":["音乐社区个人主页","潮牌上新落地页","音乐播放器界面","美妆活动页","千禧风个人主页"],"en":{"prompt":"Y2K social music profile, translucent plastic cards, chrome title, bubblegum pink and ice blue palette, friend profile, now-playing panel and guestbook columns, glossy rounded buttons, restrained star and sparkle accents","use":[{"t":"Fashion or beauty campaign","m":"style-y2k-use-brand"},{"t":"Music and youth-culture page","m":"style-y2k-use-music"},{"t":"Retro-future product launch","m":"style-y2k-use-homepage"},{"t":"Playful event or creator identity","m":"style-y2k-use-campaign"}],"dont":[{"t":"Cover text with sparkles and translucent decoration","m":"style-y2k-dont-serious","bad":true},{"t":"Use low-contrast chrome for functional labels","m":"style-y2k-dont-text","bad":true},{"t":"Mix Y2K with unrelated retro periods","m":"style-y2k-dont-full","bad":true},{"t":"Apply a playful nostalgia theme to a serious operational tool","m":"style-y2k-dont-mix","bad":true}],"principles":[{"t":"Choose a clear period reference instead of mixing every retro trend","m":"style-y2k-chrome"},{"t":"Use gloss, chrome, and transparency on focused elements","m":"style-y2k-color"},{"t":"Balance playful display type with readable body text","m":"style-y2k-bubble"},{"t":"Build a bright but controlled color palette","m":"style-y2k-gloss"},{"t":"Let decoration frame content rather than cover it","m":"style-y2k-star"}],"scenes":["Fashion campaign","Beauty launch","Music event","Creator portfolio","Retro-future product"],"sceneUI":["<div class=\"style-y2k-scene\"><div class=\"y2k-scene-nav\"><b>myspace.exe</b><span>HOME · BLOG · MIXES</span><i>● ONLINE</i></div><div class=\"y2k-scene-content\"><aside><div class=\"y2k-scene-avatar\">M</div><b>mika_wave</b><span>shanghai / 22</span><button>+ add friend</button><small>8,208 friends</small></aside><section class=\"y2k-scene-player\"><small>NOW PLAYING</small><h3>paper satellite</h3><span>mika's midnight mix</span><div class=\"y2k-scene-bar\"><i></i></div><b>◀　▶　▶</b></section><div class=\"y2k-scene-book\"><b>GUESTBOOK</b><p>lulu: u looked so cute!</p><p>yu: mixtape 4ever ♡</p><em>leave a message →</em></div></div></div>","<div style=\"max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #f0d8ea;background:#fff\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:8px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #f0d8ea\">\n        <span style=\"width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:#ff5f56\"></span><span style=\"width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:#ffbd2e\"></span><span style=\"width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:#27c93f\"></span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#b9a8cc;margin-left:6px\">bubblegum.shop</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"position:relative;background:linear-gradient(155deg,#bfe3ff,#e3f2ff 40%,#ffd9ef);padding:22px 24px;overflow:hidden\">\n        <i style=\"position:absolute;top:10px;right:12%;font-size:14px;color:#fff;text-shadow:0 0 8px rgba(255,158,214,.95);font-style:normal\">✦</i>\n        <i style=\"position:absolute;bottom:14px;left:8%;font-size:12px;color:#fff;text-shadow:0 0 8px rgba(255,158,214,.95);font-style:normal\">✧</i>\n        